contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p024","text":"張儀既出，未去，聞蘇秦死，乃說楚王曰：「秦地半天下，兵敵四國，被險帶河，四塞以為固。虎賁之士百餘萬，車千乘，騎萬匹，積粟如丘山。法令既明，士卒安難樂死，主明以嚴，將智以武，雖無出甲，席卷常山之險，必折天下之脊，天下有後服者先亡。且夫為從者，無以異於驅群羊而攻猛虎，虎之與羊不格明矣。今王不與猛虎而與群羊，臣竊以為大王之計過也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004085","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0042","start":42,"end":46,"surface":"虎賁之士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"士卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0116","start":116,"end":119,"surface":"為從者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0142","start":142,"end":143,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m024-0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p025","text":"「凡天下彊國，非秦而楚，非楚而秦，兩國交爭，其勢不兩立。大王不與秦，秦下甲據宜陽，韓之上地不通。下河東，取成皋，韓必入臣，梁則從風而動。秦攻楚之西，韓、梁攻其北，社稷安得毋危？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m025-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p026","text":"「且夫從者聚群弱而攻至彊，不料敵而輕戰，國貧而數舉兵，危亡之術也。臣聞之，兵不如者勿與挑戰，粟不如者勿與持久。夫從人飾辯虛辭，高主之節，言其利不言其害，卒有秦禍，無及為已。是故願大王之孰計之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m026-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"從者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m026-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"從人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m026-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p027","text":"「秦西有巴蜀，大船積粟，起於汶山，浮江已下，至楚三千餘里。舫船載卒，一舫載五十人與三月之食，下水而浮，一日行三百餘里，里數雖多，然而不費牛馬之力，不至十日而距扜關。扜關驚，則從境以東盡城守矣，黔中、巫郡非王之有。秦舉甲出武關，南面而伐，則北地絕。秦兵之攻楚也，危難在三月之內，而楚待諸侯之救，在半歲之外，此其勢不相及也。夫待弱國之救，忘彊秦之禍，此臣所以為大王患也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m027-0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m027-0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p028","text":"「大王嘗與吳人戰，五戰而三勝，陣卒盡矣；偏守新城，存民苦矣。臣聞功大者易危，而民敝者怨上。夫守易危之功而逆彊秦之心，臣竊為大王危之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m028-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m028-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p029","text":"「且夫秦之所以不出兵函谷十五年以攻齊、趙者，陰謀有合天下之心。楚嘗與秦構難，戰於漢中，楚人不勝，列侯執珪死者七十餘人，遂亡漢中。楚王大怒，興兵襲秦，戰於藍田。此所謂兩虎相搏者也。夫秦楚相敝而韓魏以全制其後，計無危於此者矣。願大王孰計之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m029-0048","start":48,"end":52,"surface":"列侯執珪","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m029-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m029-0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p030","text":"「秦下甲攻衛陽晉，必大關天下之匈。大王悉起兵以攻宋，不至數月而宋可舉，舉宋而東指，則泗上十二諸侯盡王之有也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m030-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m030-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p032","text":"「今秦與楚接境壤界，固形親之國也。大王誠能聽臣，臣請使秦太子入質於楚，楚太子入質於秦，請以秦女為大王箕帚之妾，效萬室之都以為湯沐之邑，長為昆弟之國，終身無相攻伐。臣以為計無便於此者。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m032-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m032-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"秦太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m032-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"楚太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m032-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"秦女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或擬議質子婚姻，未證已實行，姓名與身分不補造。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m032-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p033","text":"於是楚王已得張儀而重出黔中地與秦，欲許之。屈原曰：「前大王見欺於張儀，張儀至，臣以為大王烹之；今縱弗忍殺之，又聽其邪說，不可。」懷王曰：「許儀而得黔中，美利也。後而倍之，不可。」故卒許張儀，與秦親。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"屈原","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004109","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004103","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m033-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-070","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-070","source_id":"s-shiji-070-zhang","source":{"title":"史記／卷070","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷070","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷070&oldid=2621148","revision_id":2621148,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"59段正文，自張儀者至太史公論贊；排除ws-header人物導覽、索隱述贊與現代版權告示。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p015","witness_form":"［燕］","body_reading":"燕","note":"成對改讀保留改讀前字，方括號補字取其字並另存符號；未核底本，採用讀法不作已校定。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p027","witness_form":"（待）［恃］","body_reading":"待","note":"成對改讀保留改讀前字，方括號補字取其字並另存符號；未核底本，採用讀法不作已校定。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p034","witness_form":"［飯］","body_reading":"飯","note":"成對改讀保留改讀前字，方括號補字取其字並另存符號；未核底本，採用讀法不作已校定。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p044","witness_form":"（服）［破］","body_reading":"服","note":"成對改讀保留改讀前字，方括號補字取其字並另存符號；未核底本，採用讀法不作已校定。"}],"extraction_note":"固定HTML與取得時版本一致，只去外緣空白及另